  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. To prepare the ingredients, cut the sweet potato (unpeeled) and beetroot (washed) into 2 cm pieces. Crumble the marinated goat cheese (reserve the olive oil) and wash the mixed salad leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/585b05b39df18150e70dc3d2-0-0-1f9e4c63.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Toss the sweet potato and beetroot in the olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Place on a lined oven tray and cook in the oven for 30-35 minutes, or until golden and tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/585b05b39df18150e70dc3d2-1-0-3b7e260a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the pecans on a second oven tray and add to the oven in the final 8 minutes of the vegetable cooking time, or until toasted."
    },
    {
      "text": "• To make the dressing, combine the reserved olive oil from the marinated goat cheese, balsamic vinegar and Dijon mustard in a small jug or bowl. Season to taste with salt and pepper. Toss the mixed salad leaves, roast vegetables, pecans and goat cheese in a large bowl. Drizzle with the dressing and toss to coat well.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/585b05b39df18150e70dc3d2-3-0-e769b08c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To serve, divide the salad between bowls."
    }
  ]
}
